1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,183
Why is trading used books so hard?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,369
面交怕詐騙 寄送嫌麻煩
Meeting up feels risky. Shipping is a hassle.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,395
超過一半的人
More than half of respondents

4
00:00:08,395 --> 00:00:12,132
想要 24 小時自助存取的實體書櫃
want a physical locker with 24/7 self-service access.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,493
SaveMyBook — a used-book marketplace built around smart lockers

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,052
輸入 ISBN AI 會查詢書目
Enter the ISBN, and AI looks up the book

7
00:00:25,052 --> 00:00:26,930
自動補齊空白欄位
and fills in the blank fields.

8
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:30,436
拍下書況照片 AI 判斷書況
Photograph the book, and AI assesses its condition

9
00:00:30,436 --> 00:00:32,207
並建議合理售價
and suggests a fair price.

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,895
規則檢查加上 AI 影像審核
Rule-based checks plus AI image review

11
00:00:36,895 --> 00:00:38,825
雙層把關上架品質
keep every listing up to standard.

12
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,086
系統會根據收藏與瀏覽紀錄推薦好書
Picks based on your favorites and browsing history —

13
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:46,928
每一本都附上理由
each with a reason why.

14
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,701
只要說出需求和預算
Just describe what you need and your budget,

15
00:00:49,701 --> 00:00:52,269
AI 書籍顧問就幫你挑書
and the AI book advisor picks for you.

16
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:58,069
找到想要的書 可以在聊天室詢問賣家
Found the right book? Ask the seller in chat

17
00:00:58,069 --> 00:00:59,247
並預約保留
and reserve it.

18
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,813
偵測到私下交易或詐騙話術時
When off-platform deals or scam tactics are detected,

19
00:01:02,813 --> 00:01:04,969
系統會即時提醒雙方
both sides are warned right away.

20
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,431
付款前再驗證一次
Every payment is verified once more,

21
00:01:08,431 --> 00:01:11,179
可以用交易密碼或生物辨識
by transaction PIN or biometrics.

22
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,312
款項先由平台暫管 等交易完成才撥給賣家
The platform holds the payment until the deal is complete.

23
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,400
書櫃只用一片 ESP32 就能控制四扇櫃門
A single ESP32 controls all four locker doors

24
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,579
並與伺服器即時同步
and stays in sync with the server in real time.

25
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:29,939
賣家掃描書櫃上的 QR Code 輸入螢幕上的數字
The seller scans the locker's QR code and enters the number on its screen,

26
00:01:29,939 --> 00:01:31,796
指定的櫃門就會開啟
and the assigned door opens.

27
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,499
關上櫃門就完成存書
Closing the door completes the deposit,

28
00:01:35,499 --> 00:01:37,832
買家也會同步收到通知
and the buyer is notified at the same time.

29
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,808
前往書櫃前 App 整合臺北市政府開放資料
Before you head to a locker, the app draws on Taipei City open data

30
00:01:43,808 --> 00:01:47,817
提供捷運、公車、YouBike 與停車資訊
for MRT, bus, YouBike, and parking information.

31
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,375
管理員設置書櫃時
When setting up a locker,

32
00:01:50,375 --> 00:01:53,260
也能直接帶入目前位置的座標
admins can fill in their current coordinates directly.

33
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:57,330
買家用同樣的方式取書
The buyer picks up the book the same way;

34
00:01:57,330 --> 00:02:01,460
取書 24 小時後 款項自動撥入賣家錢包
24 hours later, the payment goes to the seller's wallet automatically.

35
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:08,088
有問題？AI 客服立即回覆
Questions? The AI assistant answers instantly.

36
00:02:08,088 --> 00:02:10,745
複雜狀況一鍵轉接真人
Complex issues go to a person in one tap.

37
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:15,038
發生爭議時 AI 會比對照片與說明
In a dispute, AI compares photos and descriptions,

38
00:02:15,038 --> 00:02:17,633
整理證據協助管理員裁決
organizing evidence to help admins decide.

39
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:22,360
從上架到售後 七項 AI 功能全程協助
Seven AI features help from listing to after-sales.

40
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:26,492
AI 用量設有上限 使用前須經同意
AI usage is capped and requires consent,

41
00:02:26,492 --> 00:02:29,366
對話紀錄 90 天後自動刪除
and chat logs are deleted after 90 days.

42
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:34,929
從 Flutter App、Node.js 後端
From the Flutter app and Node.js backend

43
00:02:34,929 --> 00:02:38,211
到 ESP32 智慧書櫃 一套系統完整串起
to the ESP32 smart locker — one connected system.

44
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:43,506
300 個 API、超過 4,000 項測試全數通過
300 APIs and 4,000+ tests, all passing,

45
00:02:43,506 --> 00:02:45,108
支援五種介面語言
in five interface languages.

46
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:48,536
服務費規劃只收一成
A planned service fee of just 10% —

47
00:02:48,536 --> 00:02:52,382
遠低於委託寄賣的三成五 賣家拿得更多
far below consignment's 35%, so sellers keep more.

48
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:56,600
Let idle books circulate again.

49
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,260
SaveMyBook

